    "type": "question",
    "label": "11",
    "prompt": "Glass costs $\\$25$ per square metre. Find the cost of glazing a window with length $225\\text{ cm}$ and width $150\\text{ cm}$. Give your answer to the nearest cent.",
    "layout": "list",
    "columns": null,
    "questionDiagrams": [],
    "children": [],
    "answer": {
      "short": "$\\$84.38$",
      "worked": "Convert the dimensions to metres.\n$$\\begin{align*}L&=225\\div100=2.25\\text{ m}\\\\W&=150\\div100=1.5\\text{ m}\\\\A&=L\\times W\\\\A&=2.25\\times1.5\\\\A&=3.375\\text{ m}^2\\\\\\text{Cost}&=3.375\\times\\$25\\\\\\text{Cost}&=\\$84.375\\\\\\text{Cost}&\\approx\\$84.38\\end{align*}$$\nThe glazing costs $\\$84.38$ to the nearest cent.",
      "solutionDiagrams": []
    },
    "answerSpaceMm": 52
  },
